# The governance templates are written byte for byte into the operator's projects
# (ADR-020): their line endings are part of what they say. Claude Code imports
# "@AGENTS.md" and Gemini CLI "@./AGENTS.md" from a line of their own, and a
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true would turn them into CRLF -- a project made from
# a Windows clone would differ from one made anywhere else. Always LF.
backend/src/main/resources/workspace-templates/*.md text eol=lf
